## Table Schema: coactive_table_adv

### Fixed base columns (always present)
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| coactive_image_id | string | Unique identifier for the keyframe. Use for counting images. |
| coactive_video_id | string | Unique identifier for the video. Use for counting videos. |
| coactive_shot_id | string | Unique identifier for the shot. Use for counting shots. |
| keyframe_index | string | Index of the keyframe within the asset |
| keyframe_time_ms | float | Start time of the keyframe in milliseconds |
| path | string | Storage path of the keyframe |
| created_dt | timestamp | Timestamp of video ingestion |
| metadata | JSON | File-level metadata |

### Discovered concept columns for this dataset
{{ concept_columns }}

Each concept appears as a pair of columns:
- `[concept_name]` → integer (0 or 1): binary flag, 1 means concept detected
- `[concept_name]_prob` → float (0.0–1.0): probability score for the concept

